Section: Planning a mission
  On: desktop
  A [[mission]] is the list of items that the autopilot flies in [[AUTO]]: waypoints,
  loiters, a takeoff, a landing or a return home. You draw it on the [[tactical map]] as a
  [[plan]] with the PLAN tool. Then you write it to the vehicle with UPLOAD. These pages
  start when you plan, so the PLAN tool is selected and the plan is empty.

Background:
  Given the map tool is PLAN
